			"date": "2024-07-19T21:26:04.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> This is why I hate when services automatically run stuff through URL shorteners. If *I* run the link through a shortener and the services goes down, yeah, I'm unhappy. But if all of my links break because something else decided to start running every URL through them, I'm extra unhappy.</p><p>Also: obligatory killedbygoogle.com mention :flan_rage:​</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
